CB30-065.effect:
Including when this Nexus is deployed, cores can't be put onto, or moved from this Nexus, besides via your "Geats" Contract Spirit's effect, including those that are in Soul State/pre-advent condition. Also, this Nexus is unaffected by opposing effects.

[LV1] (Your Attack Step)
When the number of cores on this Nexus increases:
When it becomes 1/2/3/4, you can draw a card;
When it becomes 3/4/5, you can destroy an opposing Spirit/Ultimate;
When it becomes 4/6, you can put two cores from the Void to any of your Spirits;
When it becomes 7, you win the game.
